graph LR
    KAP[kube-auth-proxy<br/>Go 1.26<br/>FIPS-compliant auth proxy]

    %% External Go Dependencies (key libraries)
    KAP -->|"HTTP routing"| GorillaMux[gorilla/mux 1.8.1]
    KAP -->|"OIDC discovery + JWT"| GoOIDC[coreos/go-oidc/v3 3.18.0]
    KAP -->|"JWT parsing"| GolangJWT[golang-jwt/jwt/v5 5.3.0]
    KAP -->|"Prometheus metrics"| PromClient[prometheus/client_golang 1.23.2]
    KAP -->|"middleware chain"| Alice[justinas/alice 1.2.0]
    KAP -->|"session serialization"| MsgPack[vmihailenco/msgpack/v5 5.4.1]
    KAP -->|"session compression"| LZ4[pierrec/lz4/v4 4.1.22]
    KAP -->|"CLI flags"| PFlag[spf13/pflag 1.0.10]
    KAP -->|"config files"| Viper[spf13/viper 1.21.0]
    KAP -->|"file watching"| FSNotify[fsnotify/fsnotify 1.9.0]

    %% Optional External Dependencies
    KAP -.->|"session storage<br/>(optional)"| GoRedis[redis/go-redis/v9 9.17.0]
    KAP -.->|"TokenReview API<br/>(optional)"| ClientGo[k8s.io/client-go 0.35.3]

    %% Internal Platform Dependencies
    KAP -->|"OAuth2 flow<br/>HTTPS/443"| OShiftOAuth[OpenShift OAuth Server]
    KAP -->|"TokenReview + User API<br/>HTTPS/443"| K8sAPI[Kubernetes API Server]
    KAP -->|"user info enrichment<br/>HTTPS/443"| OShiftUserAPI[OpenShift User API]
    KAP -->|"proxy pass-through<br/>HTTP/HTTPS"| UpstreamApp[Upstream Application]
    KAP -.->|"session storage<br/>TCP 6379/6380"| Redis[Redis Server]

    %% Integration Points (consumers of kube-auth-proxy)
    EnvoyGW[Envoy Gateway<br/>RHOAI 3.x] -->|"ext_authz<br/>HTTP/4180"| KAP
    Prometheus[Prometheus] -->|"metrics scrape<br/>HTTP/8090"| KAP
    MLflow[MLflow Python SDK] -->|"auth errors<br/>JSON response"| KAP

